                <p>Konfigurasi Linux/Windows Server, manajemen Web Server (Apache/Nginx), DNS Server, DHCP, FTP, dan Mail Server.</p>
            </div>
            <!-- Skill 3 -->
            <div class="skill-card">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-screwdriver-wrench"></i>
                <h3>Hardware & Troubleshooting</h3>
                <p>Perakitan PC/Server, perawatan hardware, diagnostik kerusakan jaringan fisik, dan instalasi sistem operasi.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Kontak Section -->
    <section id="contact">
